WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.207 --> 00:00:08.048
One fine morning, a man was taking a walk.

2
00:00:08.668 --> 00:00:11.130
"Help me," a voice cried out.

3
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.652
A snake was trapped under a pile of rocks.

4
00:00:16.553 --> 00:00:17.753
"Please help me.

5
00:00:18.374 --> 00:00:19.154
I'm stuck!"

6
00:00:19.714 --> 00:00:20.675
begged the snake.

7
00:00:21.415 --> 00:00:22.816
The man shook his head.

8
00:00:22.836 --> 00:00:25.418
"No, because you will eat me!"

9
00:00:25.438 --> 00:00:27.339
"Oh no!

10
00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:29.460
I would never eat you!"

11
00:00:30.028 --> 00:00:31.229
promised the snake.

12
00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.691
The man believed the snake.

13
00:00:35.191 --> 00:00:38.113
So, he helped the snake from under the rocks.

14
00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:43.616
"Ah, now I feel hungry," said the snake.

15
00:00:45.096 --> 00:00:48.038
"You promised not to eat me," said the man.

16
00:00:48.058 --> 00:00:52.821
"Yes, but my stomach didn't," the sly snake hissed.

17
00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:55.322
The man was very afraid.

18
00:00:55.342 --> 00:01:00.101
"Wait! Let's ask the other animals what to do," the man said.

19
00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:04.903
First, the man and the snake met a dog.

20
00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:08.986
They told him the story and asked, "What should we do?"

21
00:01:10.466 --> 00:01:14.929
The dog replied, "I used to hunt rabbits and birds for my master.

22
00:01:15.589 --> 00:01:18.071
But he never gave me good food to eat.

23
00:01:18.691 --> 00:01:24.034
Now I'm old," continued the dog, "and my master wants to kill me."

24
00:01:25.595 --> 00:01:27.336
He looked at the man angrily.

25
00:01:27.688 --> 00:01:29.869
"So I think the snake should eat you!"

26
00:01:32.129 --> 00:01:33.670
Next, they met a horse.

27
00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:37.731
They told him the story and asked, "What should we do?"

28
00:01:40.371 --> 00:01:44.212
The horse replied, "I used to carry things for my master.

29
00:01:44.793 --> 00:01:47.873
Now that I'm old, my master wants to kill me!"

30
00:01:48.614 --> 00:01:50.434
He looked at the man angrily.

31
00:01:50.454 --> 00:01:52.755
"So I think the snake should eat you!"

32
00:01:52.775 --> 00:01:59.356
"See? Two animals say I should eat you," the snake said happily.

33
00:01:59.376 --> 00:02:03.478
"Wait! Let's ask one more animal," begged the man.

34
00:02:03.498 --> 00:02:06.979
"Please, Fox, we have a question to ask."

35
00:02:07.519 --> 00:02:08.919
They told him the story.

36
00:02:08.939 --> 00:02:12.360
"Where did you find the snake?"

37
00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:13.981
the fox asked.

38
00:02:14.881 --> 00:02:17.862
The man pointed to the rocks.

39
00:02:18.382 --> 00:02:19.262
"What were you doing?"

40
00:02:19.682 --> 00:02:21.323
the fox asked the snake.

41
00:02:21.343 --> 00:02:24.724
"I was here, asking the man for help."

42
00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:27.821
The snake showed them how he got stuck.

43
00:02:27.841 --> 00:02:30.682
"Is that the way you were?"

44
00:02:31.323 --> 00:02:32.163
asked the fox.

45
00:02:32.523 --> 00:02:33.524
"Yes, yes!

46
00:02:33.824 --> 00:02:35.204
Now get me out."

47
00:02:35.865 --> 00:02:39.066
The snake tried to lift the rocks, but couldn't.

48
00:02:39.086 --> 00:02:43.768
"Then that is how you shall stay," the fox smiled slyly.
